[0m[0m
Each [38;5;10mgoto[0m in the C code becomes a state transition ([38;5;10mstate = State::LabelX; continue;[0m), and the [38;5;10mcontinue[0m statement in C (which jumps back to the while condition) maps to [38;5;10mstate = State::WhileCheck; continue;[0m. This preserves the exact control flow semantics without any [38;5;10munsafe[0m code.[0m[0m[38;5;12m[1m✓ Created checkpoint 1

